      "writtenOn": "2026-04-13T13:22:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since `js_run_binary` defaults to running in the package directory (`chdir \u003d package_name()`), the paths generated by `$(location)` and `$(locations)` (which are relative to the workspace root) won\u0027t resolve correctly inside the script without the `../../../` hack you added.\n\nInstead of hardcoding `../../../` inside `utils.ts` and `license-map-generator.ts`, you can add `chdir \u003d \"\"` here so the script runs at the workspace root. Also, it is safer to use `$@` for the output file path instead of hardcoding it.\n\n```python\n    outs \u003d [\"polygerrit-licenses.json\"],\n    args \u003d [\n        \"$(location //polygerrit-ui/app/node_modules_licenses:licenses-config-js)\",\n        \"$(location //polygerrit-ui/app/node_modules_licenses:node_modules_files)\",\n        \"$(locations //polygerrit-ui/app/node_modules_licenses:licenses-text-properties)\",\n        \"$@\",\n    ],\n    chdir \u003d \"\",\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 75,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 75,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "962d724f70888ef53079d087312a32e0db9e12b2",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
