      "writtenOn": "2026-04-13T13:22:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If `currentDir` reaches the root directory (`/`) and doesn\u0027t end with `node_modules`, `path.dirname(\u0027/\u0027)` will continue to return `/`. This will cause an infinite loop!\n\nAdd a check to break the loop if `currentDir` stops changing:\n```typescript\n      const nextDir \u003d path.dirname(currentDir);\n      if (nextDir \u003d\u003d\u003d currentDir) {\n        break;\n      }\n      currentDir \u003d nextDir;\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 102,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 102,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "962d724f70888ef53079d087312a32e0db9e12b2",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
