      "writtenOn": "2026-04-13T13:22:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the package is a scoped package (e.g., `@open-wc/testing`), `currentDir.split(\u0027/\u0027, 1)[0]` will only return the scope (`@open-wc`). This will result in an incorrect package name and `rootPath`. \n\nYou should handle scoped packages correctly by including the second part of the path if the first part starts with `@`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 114,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 114,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "962d724f70888ef53079d087312a32e0db9e12b2",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
