      "writtenOn": "2026-04-13T13:22:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The parameter name `path` shadows the imported `path` module. \n\nAdditionally, if `path` does not contain `/node_modules/`, `lastIndexOf` returns `-1`. This will evaluate to `path.substring(-1 + 14)`, which incorrectly chops off the first 13 characters of the path instead of returning safely.\n\nConsider renaming the parameter and adding a check for `-1`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 132,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 132,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "962d724f70888ef53079d087312a32e0db9e12b2",
